101
00:05:56,360 --> 00:05:59,060
Yes, I've known comfort like that.

102
00:05:59,500 --> 00:06:03,960
Family can chase away the shadows
of fear, like a light from above.

103
00:06:04,820 --> 00:06:06,480
I was only an infant,

104
00:06:06,860 --> 00:06:08,920
but I can still remember that cold,

105
00:06:09,100 --> 00:06:12,177
