lights for the first time.

106
00:06:12,260 --> 00:06:14,157
There, there, you poor sweet thing.

107
00:06:14,240 --> 00:06:18,260
She gave me shelter from the cold
and brought me into her home,

108
00:06:18,420 --> 00:06:22,840
deep below the desert sands, to
raise me as if I were her own.

109
00:06:23,380 --> 00:06:27,980
All was peaceful until the day
I discovered my family's secret.

110
00:06:28,480 --> 00:06:33,640
For generations, our clan has served the
great pharaoh by guarding his ancient tomb.

111
00:06:33,940 --> 00:06:36,780
But now, our destiny is in jeopardy.

112
00:06:36,900 --> 00:06:41,577
Who will watch over the millennium rod
and necklace if we have no children?

113
00:06:41,660 --> 00:06:45,836
For 5,000 years, we've waited in the
darkness for the pharaoh's return.

114
00:06:45,980 --> 00:06:47,620
We cannot fail him now.

115
00:06:47,860 --> 00:06:49,180
But we have Odeon.

116
00:06:49,400 --> 00:06:51,280
He can carry on our legacy.

117
00:06:51,640 --> 00:06:54,699
Why don't you give him the
Tomb Keeper's initiation?

118
00:06:55,680 --> 00:06:59,220
I already told you, Odeon
is not our flesh and blood.

119
00:06:59,420 --> 00:07:00,560
He's our only hope.

120
00:07:00,900 --> 00:07:03,740
It was fate that brought
him to us on that day.

121
00:07:04,440 --> 00:07:07,420
Please initiate Odeon
by his 12th birthday.

122
00:07:12,960 --> 00:07:17,140
She's beautiful, and her
name shall be Ishizu.

123
00:07:17,620 --> 00:07:20,620
