Tomb Keeper's initiation,

128
00:07:38,060 --> 00:07:42,240
and you shall receive this sacred
rite on your 12th birthday.

129
00:07:42,540 --> 00:07:43,952
How will this change me?

130
00:07:44,320 --> 00:07:48,260
You will bear the ancient
scriptures, my child. You'll see.

131
00:07:48,860 --> 00:07:52,620
That is if you still want to
become a tomb keeper. Of course.

132
00:07:53,080 --> 00:07:56,137
Mother, does this mean I'll be
exactly like you and Father?

133
00:07:56,220 --> 00:07:57,050
Yes, dear.

134
00:07:57,520 --> 00:07:59,820
You will truly be our son.

135
00:08:02,280 --> 00:08:03,320
Look, dear.

136
00:08:03,640 --> 00:08:04,620
It's a boy.

137
00:08:04,960 --> 00:08:05,842
Hold him, dear.

138
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:07,297
A true heir.

139
00:08:07,380 --> 00:08:09,980
We shall call him Merrick. Finally.

140
00:08:10,440 --> 00:08:11,360
Come, my son.

141
