149
00:08:34,420 --> 00:08:35,637
I was his protector.

150
00:08:35,720 --> 00:08:40,900
I'll get the ball, big
brother Here it is Oh no,

151
00:08:41,400 --> 00:08:45,340
Merrick Help it bit me

152
00:08:48,640 --> 00:08:50,440
You've disappointed me again,

153
00:08:50,580 --> 00:08:54,197
Odeon And that is
unacceptable You vowed to us

154
00:08:54,280 --> 00:08:56,977
that you would protect
Merrick And now look at him,

155
00:08:57,060 --> 00:09:00,620
Odeon He's my family's future I'm sorry,

156
00:09:00,760 --> 00:09:06,040
master Sorry's not enough Merrick's my
flesh and blood He must carry on my legacy!

157
