159
00:09:19,600 --> 00:09:20,740
I'm sorry.

160
00:09:21,120 --> 00:09:23,400
It was all my fault, big brother.

161
00:09:24,680 --> 00:09:25,510
Huh?

162
00:09:25,593 --> 00:09:27,240
Don't let your father hear you say that!

163
00:09:27,600 --> 00:09:28,560
Forget him.

164
00:09:28,940 --> 00:09:31,900
You will always be my big brother, Odeon.

165
00:09:32,300 --> 00:09:33,240
Thank you.

166
00:09:34,820 --> 00:09:37,526
I'll never let you down
again, Master Merrick.

167
00:09:37,740 --> 00:09:38,940
Please forgive me.

168
00:09:39,160 --> 00:09:41,200
I promise to always protect you.

169
00:09:41,840 --> 00:09:47,620
So Merrick devoted his life to the ancient
scriptures, and I devoted my life to him.

170
