201
00:11:13,560 --> 00:11:17,960
I'll devote my life So
Master Marek can be free

202
00:11:18,860 --> 00:11:23,640
My son will receive the initiation as
planned And you'll speak no more of this

203
00:11:28,020 --> 00:11:32,340
I'll never forget when they
took Merrick away Help! Odeon!

204
00:11:32,700 --> 00:11:37,340
I don't want to be a Tomb
Keeper Please, help me!

205
00:11:37,480 --> 00:11:38,980
