206
00:11:39,860 --> 00:11:45,680
My life has changed forever Yes,
you're a Tomb Keeper now Go!

207
00:11:47,220 --> 00:11:54,040
I'm sorry, I feel so alone Why should I
have to pledge my life to some pharaoh?

208
