217
00:12:24,660 --> 00:12:26,077
What are you waiting for?

218
00:12:26,160 --> 00:12:30,100
Finish off Joey Wheeler so we can
move on to our real opponents.

219
00:12:30,400 --> 00:12:33,517
We must defeat Yugi and
Kaiba so I can win their

220
00:12:33,600 --> 00:12:37,260
Egyptian god cards and obtain
the power of the pharaoh.

221
00:12:37,740 --> 00:12:39,080
Come on, Joey.

222
00:12:39,460 --> 00:12:40,580
Don't quit now.

223
00:12:40,940 --> 00:12:42,120
You can do it.

224
00:12:42,420 --> 00:12:44,620
Here I come. Surrender.

225
00:12:45,040 --> 00:12:47,981
You're helpless against
my mystical beast circuit.

226
00:12:48,240 --> 00:12:52,237
No matter what you draw, it will never
match the power of my ancient creature.

227
00:12:52,320 --> 00:12:57,500
And once I destroy your final monster,
I'll wipe out the rest of your life points.

228
00:12:57,860 --> 00:12:59,331
I'm still in this, Marek.

229
00:12:59,780 --> 00:13:01,460
Huh? Oh, great.

230
00:13:01,720 --> 00:13:05,097
How am I supposed to beat that thing
with three useless magic cards?

231
00:13:05,180 --> 00:13:09,320
I'll leave my fisherman in defense
mode and sit tight. Smart move.

232
00:13:09,700 --> 00:13:13,347
But forfeiting this duel would
have been an even smarter move.

233
00:13:13,440 --> 00:13:14,540
Zip it, Marek.

234
00:13:14,760 --> 00:13:17,097
You may look creepy, but I'm not scared.

235
00:13:17,180 --> 00:13:19,320
and there's absolutely no way

236
00:13:19,840 --> 00:13:20,670
I'll lose.

237
00:13:20,753 --> 00:13:25,940
My little sister can finally see me duel
and I'll make sure she sees me wait.

238
00:13:26,160 --> 00:13:27,980
Is that so, Mr. Wheeler?

239
00:13:28,340 --> 00:13:29,660
How very touching.

240
00:13:30,020 --> 00:13:32,040
But nothing can save you now.

241
00:13:32,440 --> 00:13:33,380
Too bad.

242
00:13:33,780 --> 00:13:35,617
He's made some great comebacks.

243
00:13:35,700 --> 00:13:39,171
But I think his streak will
finally end here on this blimp.

244
00:13:39,380 --> 00:13:42,797
He's definitely come a long way
since the last time I dueled him.

245
00:13:42,880 --> 00:13:43,710
Oh, well.

246
00:13:43,793 --> 00:13:46,280
He did the best that he could. Wait, Mike.

247
00:13:47,180 --> 00:13:48,356
