248
00:13:49,260 --> 00:13:51,180
Your turn. You're right.

249
00:13:51,480 --> 00:13:54,833
They burn with a fire that
I've never seen in him before.

250
00:13:55,060 --> 00:13:57,236
It's like he knows he's going to win.

251
00:13:57,560 --> 00:13:58,440
